{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dealmaster is business strategy game where players try to maximize their assets(money and properties) and minimize the assets of their opponents. Some of the prominent features of the game are<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/afa16a0082dc0065cae64f7c3d5bbb35.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Every player pick a role in the start of\u00a0 the game and then get bonus of that role throughout the game. Every role has unique features and playing style. You always strategize your game according to your role.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/87ef995055bb632ea88c1c5f4dc41b69.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>When any player lands on any unsold property it gets auctioned by and highest bidder of that gets property. This is because everyone should get a chance in every property rather than praying for dice roll<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/37e72b8a4ccdf2acb39af54b6cf9667f.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Players get the action cards when they land on certain tiles on board. They can keep the cards and play whenever they think is the right time. Timing is the most important part of action cards. Usually you hurt any opponent with it or get yourself an advantage with them. This is most fun part of game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/043b3b410dbf861ad56cdbca556c7abd.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>This is the most strategic part of game. When player completes round they get a chance to use stock exchange they can invest into stock exchange and in next rounds they can revtieve more profitted amounts.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/f8ff28a150ebbcab911032c341b8c76f.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Usually properties have minimal rents but you can increase them by building houses. You can build them for specifc price which is different for each set. You can also sell them later but at low price.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/8236cee0f3b22efec7818eb5af795bb0.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Houses can only be build on sets which are complete. So to complete the sets mostly players will need to trade some properties. So players can trade properties and money or both.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/3995cd4d9fc8dac83da1fb493704e59e.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Game has different games, different maps and a lot of custom settings so there is no place for boredom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/dd667089156ceee13496fa8dbb5fac12.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Once you purchase them game you are equal to any other player. No charges for anything after that.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010680?t=1771924039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010680?t=1771924039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/8a7c0105fd719b03c9d51d5ef361db895ad1c785/capsu