04e59e.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Game has different games, different maps and a lot of custom settings so there is no place for boredom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/extras/dd667089156ceee13496fa8dbb5fac12.avif?t=1771924039\" width=1000 height=120 /></span><br><br>Once you purchase them game you are equal to any other player. No charges for anything after that.</p>","developers":["Maheer Saimoon Ali"],"ext_user_account_notice":"DealMaster Account ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010680/effc261eba5461a03de51f2b377e537a9e8d7551/header.jpg?t=1771924039","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All art, music, and code in DealMaster are original creations by our team. The game does not use third-party IP. The server is hosted on DigitalOcean, but that is only for backend infrastructure and does not involve third-party intellectual property.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010680/1723010964/701750368486c449f1a2b8995a6623a473a9f87e/1757020859/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757526825","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010680/1723010964/701750368486c449f1a2b8995a6623a473a9f87e/1757020859/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757526825","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4010680/1723010964/701750368486c449f1a2b8995a6623a473a9f87e/1757020859/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757526825","id":257193386,"name":"Main Trail